      </p>

      <h3>Your rights</h3>
      <p>
        Under GDPR Arts. 15-21 you have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data portability, and the right to object. Since this website does not collect or store personal data, there are generally no stored data that could be affected.
      </p>
      <p>
